From: Zaurus OS
Subject: [PATCH] src/ui_pixbuf_save.c: libpng 1.5+ opaque png_struct

png_struct became an opaque type in libpng 1.5 (2010) - direct member
access like png_ptr->jmpbuf no longer compiles against our libpng 1.6.x
("invalid use of incomplete typedef"). Use the png_jmpbuf() accessor
macro instead, the standard libpng-1.5+-compatible replacement. Only
one call site in the whole tree used the old direct-access pattern.
---
--- a/src/ui_pixbuf_save.c
+++ b/src/ui_pixbuf_save.c
@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@
 	    	return FALSE;
 		}
 
-	if (setjmp (png_ptr->jmpbuf))
+	if (setjmp (png_jmpbuf(png_ptr)))
 		{
 		png_destroy_write_struct (&png_ptr, &info_ptr);
 		fclose (handle);
